  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "系統分析與設計",
    "sub_ename": "INFORMATION SYSTEM ANALYSIS & DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "課程目的在利用傳統系統開發結合當前技術，介紹系統分析與設計的實際方法。 \n 定義並詳細說明系統開發生命週期的五階段： \n 系統規劃，系統分析，系統設計，系統實作和系統運作。 \n 對於有興趣的學生而言，可幫助他們進一步的了解何謂系統、如何有條理的研究一個系統，以及需要哪些重要的工具和技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce a practical approach to system analysis and design using a blend of traditional development with current technologies. \n Define and describe in detail the five phases of the system development life cycle: \n system planning, system analysis, system design, system implementation, and system operation. \n It should be of interest to students who need to know about what a system is, how a system can be studied systematically, and which tools and techniques are essential to such a study.",
    "pre_subname": "IECS2001資料結構",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IECS2001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IECS2001 DATA STRUCTURE",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解大型軟體系統開發的策略與方法學",
      "describe_en": "Understand the strategy and methodology of Large Scale software system development"
